  "published": "2026-11-28",
  "updated": "2026-11-28",
  "intro": "Zoho Expense, Ramp, Brex, BILL Spend & Expense, Sage Expense Management and Rydoo are six alternatives to [Expensify](https://www.expensify.com/), and four of them publish a software price below Expensify's $5 per member per month. At 100 members, Expensify Collect costs $500 a month ($6,000 a year), while Ramp Free, Brex Essentials and BILL Spend & Expense each list $0 per user and Zoho Expense Standard comes to $400. Two Expensify alternatives cost more at that size: Rydoo Essentials at $1,200 a month and Sage Expense Management Growth at $1,199.\n\nAt The Modern Wallet, we modeled each published per-seat price at 5, 25 and 100 members so the totals sit side by side in the table below. The model counts software fees only and leaves out corporate card rewards, travel booking fees, implementation fees and negotiated enterprise discounts. For more providers priced against two of these, see our [Ramp alternatives](/alternatives/ramp/) and [Brex alternatives](/alternatives/brex/) pages.\n\nThree alternatives list $0 per user (Ramp Free, Brex Essentials and BILL Spend & Expense), and Zoho Expense's Free plan costs nothing for teams of up to 3 users. Expensify also lists its own Submit plan as free. Teams that only need a written record can start with our [expense report template](/templates/expense-report-template/), and every head-to-head page we publish sits on our [comparisons hub](/compare/).",
